  "note": "Lean proves (12.12) for all R > 0. Erratum: The constant 7.284 = 0.9105*8 in (12.12) comes from [Ram95] (3.9), prod_p (1 + (p^{1/3}+p^{2/3})/(p(p-1))) <= 8, but that product passes 8 at p = 14629 and is about 8.0836, so the cited argument gives about 7.36 (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_12_12.py`)."
